OL,3,ANigeria moves to end jail terms for
OL,4,Aattempted suicide
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigerian President Bola Tinubu has
OL,7,Fasked parliament to decriminalise
OL,8,Fattempted suicide, proposing medical
OL,9,Fsupport instead of prosecution for
OL,10,Fthose who survive.
OL,12,FThe proposal seeks to shift Nigeria's
OL,13,Fapproach from criminal punishment to
OL,14,Ftreatment and rehabilitation.
OL,16,FIt follows years of calls for reform
OL,17,Ffrom mental health professionals. A
OL,18,Fseparate bill seeking to decriminalise
OL,19,Fattempted suicide has already passed
OL,20,Fits second reading in the Senate.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
