OL,3,ANigeria moves to end jail terms for
OL,4,Aattempted suicide
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder Nigeria's law, attempted suicide
OL,7,Fis a criminal offence with those
OL,8,Fconvicted facing up to one year's
OL,9,Fimprisonment, a fine or both.
